                                                  Category::RendererAdvanced};
+    // GPU fences. 1 = Doris: with GPU Fence Behavior "Immediate" (or "Default" below High GPU
+    // accuracy) the game is told the GPU is done only once it has run the work and the bytes it
+    // wrote into buffers are back in guest memory, as "Balanced" does (fences with nothing to
